{"html": "<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 10 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">生成模型：从潜变量与对抗学习到 diffusion、flow 与 consistency</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Generative, Diffusion &amp; Flow</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_045_pix2pix-title\">pix2pix</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">以 U-Net 生成器保持逐像素空间对应，70×70 conditional PatchGAN 学局部真实感，并用配对 L1 锚定结构。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Pairs a U-Net generator (preserving pixel-level spatial alignment) with a 70×70 conditional PatchGAN discriminator and paired L1 structural anchoring.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">空间配准的成对源域图像 x 与目标域图像 y</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Spatially co-registered paired source image x and target ground-truth image y</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">与 x 对齐的目标域预测 G(x)</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Spatially aligned translated target-domain image G(x)</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 2 · PDF p.3</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始方法示意图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content_cvpr_2017/html/Isola_Image-To-Image_Translation_With_CVPR_2017_paper.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_045_pix2pix')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_045_pix2pix')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"pix2pix original paper architecture figure, Figure 2\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/821e89c819b81693fd9f.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 2 · PDF p.3</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 10 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_045_pix2pix', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_045_pix2pix\" onclick=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_045_pix2pix')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_045_pix2pix', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_045_pix2pix\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 10 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">条件图像 x</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 01</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">源域图像同时输入 generator 和 discriminator，限定生成内容。</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests spatially co-registered paired source image x and target ground-truth image y and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"源域图像同时输入 generator 和 discriminator，限定生成内容。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests spatially co-registered paired source image x and target ground-truth image y and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"条件图像 x\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 01\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_045_pix2pix', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">条件图像 x</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 01</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">源域图像同时输入 generator 和 discriminator，限定生成内容。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests spatially co-registered paired source image x and target ground-truth image y and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"逐层下采样提取从局部纹理到全局语义的条件特征。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes U-Net Encoder to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"U-Net Encoder\" data-node-name-en=\"U-Net Encoder\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_045_pix2pix', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>U-Net Encoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">逐层下采样提取从局部纹理到全局语义的条件特征。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes U-Net Encoder to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"最深层压缩表示捕获整体结构；训练时 dropout 可提供随机性。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Generator Bottleneck within the core paired conditional unet patchgan computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"Generator Bottleneck\" data-node-name-en=\"Generator Bottleneck\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_045_pix2pix', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Generator Bottleneck</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">最深层压缩表示捕获整体结构；训练时 dropout 可提供随机性。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Generator Bottleneck within the core paired conditional unet patchgan computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"转置卷积/上采样逐级恢复目标域分辨率。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs U-Net Decoder within the core paired conditional unet patchgan computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"U-Net Decoder\" data-node-name-en=\"U-Net Decoder\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_045_pix2pix', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>U-Net Decoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">转置卷积/上采样逐级恢复目标域分辨率。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs U-Net Decoder within the core paired conditional unet patchgan computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"同尺度 encoder 特征拼接到 decoder，直接传递边缘与空间位置。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Skip Concats within the core paired conditional unet patchgan computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"长 Skip Concats\" data-node-name-en=\"Skip Concats\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_045_pix2pix', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">长 Skip Concats</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Skip Concats</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">同尺度 encoder 特征拼接到 decoder，直接传递边缘与空间位置。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Skip Concats within the core paired conditional unet patchgan computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"与输入逐像素对齐的目标域预测。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs objective G(x within the core paired conditional unet patchgan computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"生成目标 G(x)\" data-node-name-en=\"objective G(x\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_045_pix2pix', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">生成目标 G(x)</span><span class=\"lang-en\">objective G(x</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">与输入逐像素对齐的目标域预测。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs objective G(x within the core paired conditional unet patchgan computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"同一对象/位置的真实目标域图像。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Stage 07 within the core paired conditional unet patchgan computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"配对真值 y\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 07\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_045_pix2pix', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">配对真值 y</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 07</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">同一对象/位置的真实目标域图像。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Stage 07 within the core paired conditional unet patchgan computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"判别器对 x 与 y/G(x) 的局部 patch 对输出真假网格，而非单一全图分数。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs 70×70 PatchGAN within the core paired conditional unet patchgan computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"70×70 PatchGAN\" data-node-name-en=\"70×70 PatchGAN\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_045_pix2pix', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>70×70 PatchGAN</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">判别器对 x 与 y/G(x) 的局部 patch 对输出真假网格，而非单一全图分数。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs 70×70 PatchGAN within the core paired conditional unet patchgan computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"鼓励生成局部纹理落在真实条件目标分布。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies cGAN Loss to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"8\" data-node-name=\"cGAN Loss\" data-node-name-en=\"cGAN Loss\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_045_pix2pix', 8)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">09</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>cGAN Loss</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">鼓励生成局部纹理落在真实条件目标分布。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies cGAN Loss to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"像素 L1 保持配对图的低频结构与整体对应，并与对抗损失加权相加。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces spatially aligned translated target-domain image g(x) via L1 Fidelity.\" data-node-idx=\"9\" data-node-name=\"L1 Fidelity\" data-node-name-en=\"L1 Fidelity\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_045_pix2pix', 9)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">10</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>L1 Fidelity</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">像素 L1 保持配对图的低频结构与整体对应，并与对抗损失加权相加。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces spatially aligned translated target-domain image g(x) via L1 Fidelity.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"pix2pix Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · pix2pix 结合条件对抗真实感与配对 L1 保真</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Conditional PatchGAN Adversarial Objective Coupled with Paired L1 Pixel Fidelity</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"pix2pix：核心公式 · pix2pix 结合条件对抗真实感与配对 L1 保真\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"45\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"13.834277pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.852406 -69.064245 187.25871 13.834277\" width=\"187.25871pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M5.697191-2.272921V-2.828745H.615376V-2.272921H5.697191Z\" id=\"m045_g2-0\"></path><path d=\"M7.364661-.665003L7.315034-.764257C6.888241-.297763 6.26294 0 5.627713 0C4.545842 0 3.503673-.327539 2.47143-.595525C3.5533-1.558291 4.168676-2.650087 4.406886-4.079348C4.525991-4.823754 4.635171-6.511075 5.67734-6.511075C6.114059-6.511075 6.491225-6.352269 6.491225-5.855998C6.491225-5.657489 6.39197-5.468906 6.253014-5.32995V-5.220771C6.491225-5.300174 7.265407-5.657489 7.265407-5.945326C7.265407-6.580553 6.441597-6.838614 5.925476-6.838614C3.215836-6.838614 3.384568-4.02972 2.858521-2.133965C2.769192-1.796501 2.302697-.744406 1.895755-.744406C1.617843-.744406 1.349857-.853586 1.071945-.853586C.704705-.853586 .208434-.12903 .069478 .168732L.119105 .23821C.287837 .099254 .535973-.059553 .764257-.059553C2.441653-.059553 3.980093 .853586 5.657489 .853586C6.669882 .853586 7.066899 .198508 7.364661-.665003Z\" id=\"m045_g2-76\"></path><path d=\"M3.255538 1.915606V-7.017272H2.699714V1.915606H3.255538ZM1.270454 1.915606V-7.017272H.71463V1.915606H1.270454Z\" id=\"m045_g2-107\"></path><path d=\"M2